
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dr Donut Community</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #0b0b0e;
    color: white;
}

/* NAVBAR */
nav {
    height: 75px;
    padding: 0 8%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: #111115;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #28282e;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #ff982f;
}

nav a {
    color: #aaa;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-left: 22px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #ff982f;
}

/* HERO */
.hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 105px 20px 75px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #542c163d, transparent 65%);
}

.tag {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #ffad55;
    background: #ff982f18;
    border: 1px solid #ff982f55;
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 9px 18px;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 70px);
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.hero h1 span {
    color: #ff982f;
}

.hero p {
    color: #aaa;
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: auto;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.verify-box {
    background: #17171d;
    border: 1px solid #393039;
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
    padding: 28px;
    border-radius: 16px;
}

.verify-icon {
    font-size: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.verify-box h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.verify-box p {
    font-size: 14px;
}

.verify-btn {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 23px;
    padding: 15px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #ff982f;
    color: #111;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    opacity: .5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
}

.notice {
    margin-top: 15px;
    color: #ffae61;
    font-size: 12px;
}

/* STATS */
.stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    max-width: 950px;
    margin: 0 auto 80px;
    padding: 0 20px;
}

.stat {
    background: #15151b;
    border: 1px solid #292930;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 25px;
    text-align: center;
}

.stat h2 {
    color: #ff982f;
    font-size: 27px;
}

.stat p {
    color: #888;
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
}

/* SECTIONS */
.section {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 40px 20px 90px;
}

.section-title {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 30px;
}

.section-description {
    color: #888;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #17171d;
    border: 1px solid #303039;
    border-radius: 13px;
    padding: 27px;
    min-height: 190px;
    opacity: .65;
}

.card:hover {
    border-color: #ff982f;
}

.card-icon {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.card h3 {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.card p {
    color: #999;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.lock {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    right: 18px;
    color: #ff982f;
    font-size: 19px;
}

.locked-label {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #ffae61;
    background: #ff982f17;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 10px;
    margin-top: 16px;
}

/* MARKET */
.market {
    margin: 0 20px 80px;
    padding: 30px;
    background: #17171d;
    border: 1px solid #303039;
    border-radius: 15px;
    text-align: center;
}

.market h2 {
    color: #ff982f;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.market p {
    color: #999;
}

/* FOOTER */
footer {
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid #292930;
    padding: 35px 20px;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 12px;
}

footer span {
    color: #ff982f;
}

@media(max-width: 700px) {
    nav {
        padding: 0 15px;
    }

    nav a {
        margin-left: 8px;
        font-size: 11px;
    }

    .stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
        padding-top: 70px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
    <div class="logo">🍩 DR DONUT</div>
    <div>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#features">Features 🔒</a>
        <a href="#community">Community 🔒</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<!-- HOME -->
<section class="hero" id="home">

    <div class="tag">✦ OFFICIAL COMMUNITY EXPERIENCE ✦</div>

    <h1>WELCOME TO<br>
    <span>DR DONUT COMMUNITY</span></h1>

    <p>
        Join the community, discover exclusive features,
        participate in events and connect with other players.
        Your journey starts here.
    </p>

    <div class="verify-box">

        <div class="verify-icon">🔐</div>

        <h2>Verification Required</h2>

        <p>
            Before accessing the Dr Donut Community,
            you must complete the verification process.
            All community features are currently locked.
        </p>

        <button class="verify-btn" disabled>
            🔒 VERIFY NOW
        </button>

        <div class="notice">
            Verification system is currently unavailable.
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<!-- STATS -->
<div class="stats">

    <div class="stat">
        <h2>🔒</h2>
        <p>Community Members</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stat">
        <h2>🔒</h2>
        <p>Events</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stat">
        <h2>🔒</h2>
        <p>Rewards</p>
    </div>

</div>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="section" id="features">

    <h2 class="section-title">Explore Features</h2>

    <p class="section-description">
        Discover everything available in our community.
        Complete verification to unlock access.
    </p>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <div class="lock">🔒</div>
            <div class="card-icon">🏆</div>
            <h3>Leaderboard</h3>
            <p>Check rankings and see the best community members.</p>
            <div class="locked-label">VERIFICATION REQUIRED</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="lock">🔒</div>
            <div class="card-icon">🎁</div>
            <h3>Rewards</h3>
            <p>Discover exclusive rewards and special bonuses.</p>
            <div class="locked-label">VERIFICATION REQUIRED</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="lock">🔒</div>
            <div class="card-icon">🎉</div>
            <h3>Events</h3>
            <p>Participate in exciting community events.</p>
            <div class="locked-label">VERIFICATION REQUIRED</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="lock">🔒</div>
            <div class="card-icon">👥</div>
            <h3>Community</h3>
            <p>Meet players and become part of our community.</p>
            <div class="locked-label">VERIFICATION REQUIRED</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="lock">🔒</div>
            <div class="card-icon">📜</div>
            <h3>Rules</h3>
            <p>Read community rules and important information.</p>
            <div class="locked-label">VERIFICATION REQUIRED</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="lock">🔒</div>
            <div class="card-icon">🎧</div>
            <h3>Support</h3>
            <p>Get help and find answers to your questions.</p>
            <div class="locked-label">VERIFICATION REQUIRED</div>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<!-- COMMUNITY -->
<section class="market" id="community">

    <h2>🍩 Your Community. Your Story.</h2>

    <p>
        A new experience is waiting for you.
        Complete verification to access the community.
    </p>

</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 <span>Dr Donut Community</span></p>
    <p style="margin-top:10px">
        Community fan project. Not an official Dr Donut website.
    </p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>


